# In a 40-column terminal the status line still shows a message such as Quick Add's "No INBOX project in the Navigator".
# BUG: the file path fills the status line and pushes every transient message past its right edge (ui.md §1 lists messages in the status line but says nothing of a long path).
size 40 10
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
END
keys qi
status No INBOX project
quit
